From f48146ebaad0c0c7181e86679b0ad8118431599d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Camilla=20L=C3=B6wy?= <elmindreda@elmindreda.org>
Date: Mon, 11 Feb 2019 19:10:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] Rename raw input to raw mouse motion, cleanup

This renames 'raw input' to 'raw mouse motion' as there are other kinds
of raw input.  The update path is restructured to avoid reinitializing
all of disabled cursor mode.  Modification of shared state is moved out
into shared code.  Raw mouse motion is disabled by default for
compatibility.

Related to #1401.
